license: "Apache"

keywords:
  - Approximate Nearest Neighbour Search
  - ANN
  - ANNS
  - GPU
  - CUDA
  - Billion-scale search
  - Vector search
  - Graph-based ANNS
  - High-performance computing
  - Similarity search

abstract: >-
  BANG is a GPU-based billion-scale approximate nearest neighbour
  search system that enables graph-based ANNS on datasets that do
  not entirely fit in GPU memory. The system leverages compressed
  representations on GPU, host-resident graph traversal, and
  overlapping communication/computation pipelines for efficient
  large-scale search.

